# Development files
.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
.github/**
src/**
scripts/**
out/**
.kiro/**

# Configuration files
.gitignore
.yarnrc
webpack.config.js
**/tsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
BUILD.md
PACKAGING.md
PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md

# Source maps and TypeScript
