# Rust source and build artifacts
rust-analyzer/**
!rust-analyzer/bin/**

# Documentation (keep only essential)
*_SUMMARY.md
*_GUIDE.md
*_IMPLEMENTATION.md

# Node modules (should be bundled)
node_modules/**

# Test files
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.ts
test/**

# Misc
.DS_Store
*.log
*.vsix
icon.png.placeholder
